del for Selecting the Optimum Oil Production Profile Using Multi Criteria Decision Making and Social Choice Theory {'source_url': 'https://api.semanticscholar.org/graph/v1/paper/03a41e33fa4d8321b982b84fc07895d71853f702?fields=paperId%2Ctitle%2Cyear%2Cvenue%2CcitationCount%2CcitationStyles%2Curl'}\nBlair2025GeneratingFC Generating Fair Consensus Statements with Social Choice on Token-Level MDPs {'source_url': 'https://api.semanticscholar.org/graph/v1/paper/b21807e3e7b81e1823da7ed1bb069fd22da9c885?fields=paperId%2Ctitle%2Cyear%2Cvenue%2CcitationCount%2CcitationStyles%2Curl'}\nThakur2019MAJORITYSC MAJORITY STABILITY: COMBINING SOCIAL CHOICE AND MATCHING THEORY TO UNDERSTAND INSTITUTIONAL STABILITY {'source_url': 'https://api.semanticscholar.org/graph/v1/paper/ca9cf7e2f3a6de585a77a0d8676ab579c24f6f94?fields=paperId%2Ctitle%2Cyear%2Cvenue%2CcitationCount%2CcitationStyles%2Curl'}\nY2025TeoriDI Teori Dan Implementasi Pengambilan Keputusan Dan Kaitannya Dengan Teori Rational Choice Dalam Administrasi Publik {'source_url': 'https://api.semanticscholar.org/graph/v1/paper/7bad344be2dd670e2fa8d91a40834d951c645eb3?fields=paperId%2Ctitle%2Cyear%2Cvenue%2CcitationCount%2CcitationStyles%2Curl'}\nCai2016AMO A method of competition result evaluation based on social choice theory {'source_url': 'https://api.semanticscholar.org/graph/v1/paper/f743c796a7561bf1684196aefa5df5a42086f362?fields=paperId%2Ctitle%2Cyear%2Cvenue%2CcitationCount%2CcitationStyles%2Curl'}\nKong2005OccupationCA Occupation, Class, and Social Networks in Urban China* {'source_url': 'https://api.semanticscholar.org/graph/v1/paper/1d8b7c9962ec7e7516ffb2efb6e113be0403015d?fields=paperId%2Ctitle%2Cyear%2Cvenue%2CcitationCount%2CcitationStyles%2Curl'}\nGS episode {'candidate_diagnostics_trust': 'unverified', 'episode_count': 3, 'evaluation_scope': 'sealed_final', 'id': 'final.evidence.episodes', 'json_pointer': '/episodes', 'manifest_path': 'work/results/a01/codex/20261117_111437/final_evaluation/final_manifest.json', 'pa