ry-only; production candidate has no task/results mounts. Scaffolding does not certify novel research, full-panel optima, license redistribution permission or the eventual conference manuscript.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"interface\": \"python_rpc_v1:handle\",\n    \"editable_paths\": [\n      \"program_0/src\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evaluators\": {\n    \"search\": \"evaluate.py\",\n    \"final\": \"evaluate_final.py\"\n  },\n  \"resources\": {\n    \"search_root\": \"resources/search\",\n    \"final_root\": \"resources/final\",\n    \"public_artifact_bundle\": null\n  },\n  \"data\": {\n    \"search_roles\": [\n      \"search_public_scores\",\n      \"search_matched_controls\",\n      \"search_exact_audits\"\n    ],\n    \"final_roles\": [\n      \"final_public_scores\",\n      \"final_matched_controls\",\n      \"final_exact_audits\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"metrics\": {\n    \"search\": [\n      {\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
